@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class Main <<Client>>
class Provider <<Value Object>>
class ProviderFactorySelector <<Factory Selector>> {
  +select(provider): CloudResourceFactory
}
interface CloudResourceFactory <<Abstract Factory>> {
  +getProvider(): Provider
  +createVirtualMachine(): VirtualMachine
  +createObjectStorage(gb): ObjectStorage
  +createMessageQueue(): MessageQueue
}
class AwsResourceFactory <<Concrete Factory>>
class AzureResourceFactory <<Concrete Factory>>
interface VirtualMachine <<Abstract Product>> {
  +getProvider(): Provider
}
interface ObjectStorage <<Abstract Product>> {
  +getProvider(): Provider
}
interface MessageQueue <<Abstract Product>> {
  +getProvider(): Provider
}
class AwsVirtualMachine <<Concrete Product>>
class AwsObjectStorage <<Concrete Product>>
class AwsMessageQueue <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureVirtualMachine <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureObjectStorage <<Concrete Product>>
class AzureMessageQueue <<Concrete Product>>
class EnvironmentProvisioner <<Director / Client>>
class ProvisioningRequest
class Environment
class AppConfig <<Singleton>> {
  -INSTANCE: AppConfig
  -AppConfig()
  +getInstance(): AppConfig
}
class AuditLog <<Thread-safe Singleton>> {
  -INSTANCE: AuditLog
  -AuditLog()
  +getInstance(): AuditLog
  +register(...)
}
class AuditRecord
class Money <<Utility>>

Main --> ProviderFactorySelector : escolhe provedor
ProvisioningRequest --> Provider
ProviderFactorySelector ..> AwsResourceFactory : instancia / cacheia
ProviderFactorySelector ..> AzureResourceFactory : instancia / cacheia
CloudResourceFactory <|.. AwsResourceFactory
CloudResourceFactory <|.. AzureResourceFactory
VirtualMachine <|.. AwsVirtualMachine
ObjectStorage <|.. AwsObjectStorage
MessageQueue <|.. AwsMessageQueue
VirtualMachine <|.. AzureVirtualMachine
ObjectStorage <|.. AzureObjectStorage
MessageQueue <|.. AzureMessageQueue
AwsResourceFactory ..> AwsVirtualMachine : cria
AwsResourceFactory ..> AwsObjectStorage : cria
AwsResourceFactory ..> AwsMessageQueue : cria
AzureResourceFactory ..> AzureVirtualMachine : cria
AzureResourceFactory ..> AzureObjectStorage : cria
AzureResourceFactory ..> AzureMessageQueue : cria
EnvironmentProvisioner --> CloudResourceFactory : recebe uma fabrica
EnvironmentProvisioner --> ProvisioningRequest
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> Environment : monta
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> AppConfig : consulta orcamento
Environment ..> AppConfig : consulta regiao
EnvironmentProvisioner ..> AuditLog : registra resultado
Environment ..> Money : formata custo
Environment o-- VirtualMachine
Environment o-- ObjectStorage
Environment o-- MessageQueue
AuditLog o-- AuditRecord

note right of CloudResourceFactory
  Abstract Factory garante que os tres
  recursos pertencem a mesma familia
  (AWS ou Azure).
end note
note bottom of AppConfig
  Singleton: config.properties e lido
  uma unica vez na inicializacao.
end note
note bottom of AuditLog
  Singleton + metodos sincronizados:
  sequencia e historico seguros em threads.
end note
@enduml
